{"id":"bad662f9e2c57951","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-order2-infimum.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Infimum","display":"df-zfc-order2-infimum — ZFC Order2 Infimum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-infimum"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-infimum — ZFC Order2 Infimum","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-infimum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-infimum — ZFC Order2 Infimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,A,s\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,A,s\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (relation-first predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}infimum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,A,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\land s\\in P\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(s\\leq_P a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_P a))\\to b\\leq_P s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}infimum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,A,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\land s\\in P\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(s\\leq_P a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_P a))\\to b\\leq_P s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (relation-first predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,A,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}infimum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,A,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\land s\\in P\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(s\\leq_P a)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_P a))\\to b\\leq_P s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":980,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8d08ba6034ca00d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)$ (infimum predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-order2-infimum.md]])"},{"id":"6e500b8443915190","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1bd10f9796e9a07","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2933","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-order2-infimum.md|58-df-zfc-order2-infimum]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2aa29158e60b337f"]}